on horsepower booked at higher rates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/archrock-inc-aroc-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"AROC 2018 Q3","e":"aroc","d":"2018-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bradley Childers","x":"So the point there being that, it's a trade-off between getting more tenure in a contract versus having more pricing flexibility to pass-through costs for the future that we're trading-off.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/archrock-inc-aroc-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"AROC 2018 Q4","e":"aroc","d":"2019-02-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Charlie Barber","x":"So just curious is that mostly just the pricing increases that you've passing through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/20/archrock-aroc-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"AROC 2018 Q4","e":"aroc","d":"2019-02-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brad Childers","x":"And so we can implement a price increase on units that are out of term.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/20/archrock-aroc-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"AROC 2019 Q1","e":"aroc","d":"2019-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"D. Bradley Childers","x":"Our dividend was 10% higher over the prior period and we delivered strong dividend coverage of 2.8 times We grew contract operations revenue by 13% compared to the prior year period, reflecting an increase of 8% in our average operating horsepower, and the benefit of further price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/archrock-inc-aroc-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AROC 2019 Q1","e":"aroc","d":"2019-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"D. Bradley Childers","x":"Compression utilization across the industry remains strong and we're seeing 20% year-over-year price increases on the high demand units we're deploying to our customer sites.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/archrock-inc-aroc-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AROC 2019 Q2","e":"aroc","d":"2019-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas S. Aron","x":"We achieved gross margin of 62%, benefiting from price increases, strong execution by our operations team and disciplined maintenance practices which helped drive lower costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/archrock-inc-aroc-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AROC 2019 Q2","e":"aroc","d":"2019-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas S. Aron","x":"…about how well the organization is managing execution in the field and the combination of the price increases we've obtained over the last two years, the continued price stability we see in the marketplace, as well as the execution in the field is going to continue to support our performance…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/archrock-inc-aroc-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AROC 2019 Q2","e":"aroc","d":"2019-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Charles Barber","x":"If I could just go back to the margins there on contract operations, can you maybe give a little more color on that cost reduction quarter-over-quarter and how that kind of plays into your expectations to kind of keep margins around that, you know, 61%, 62% kind of moving forward?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/archrock-inc-aroc-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AROC 2019 Q2","e":"aroc","d":"2019-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"D. Bradley Childers","x":"Well, even in today's call, we reaffirmed our guidance range on the synergies at $5 million, which is the same as we had at transaction announcement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/archrock-inc-aroc-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AROC 2019 Q3","e":"aroc","d":"2019-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"D. Bradley Childers","x":"Spot pricing on units placed in the service remains constructive but the rates of double-digit annual price increases that we experienced over the last few years has moderated, which is consistent with the deceleration in production growth that is expected.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/archrock-inc-aroc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AROC 2019 Q3","e":"aroc","d":"2019-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Doug S. Aron","x":"We delivered gross margin and contract operations of $122 million, up from $100 million in the prior year quarter as, again, we benefited from price increases, a larger operating fleet and focused cost management.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/archrock-inc-aroc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AROC 2019 Q4","e":"aroc","d":"2020-02-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"D. Bradley Childers","x":"In 2020, we will continue to benefit from the contract price increases implemented in 2018 and 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/archrock-inc-aroc-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AROC 2019 Q4","e":"aroc","d":"2020-02-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas S. Aron","x":"We delivered gross margin in contract operations of $128 million, up from $105 million in the prior year quarter as we benefited from price increases, a larger and high-graded operating fleet as well as focused cost management.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/archrock-inc-aroc-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AROC 2019 Q4","e":"aroc","d":"2020-02-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"D. Bradley Childers","x":"But when I think about the opportunity, it's going to be driven on driven primarily around how pricing develops through the year on the revenue side and our opportunity to continue to take cost out of the organization, impacting the upside potential on gross margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/archrock-inc-aroc-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AROC 2020 Q1","e":"aroc","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Doug S. Aron","x":"Finally, we took a $2 million restructuring charge, primarily related to severance benefits Turning to our business segments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/archrock-inc-aroc-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AROC 2020 Q1","e":"aroc","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Bradley Childers","x":"We completed the business unit reorganization and we saw an opportunity to streamline our organizational structure and better align our teams for maximum customer service and profitability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/archrock-inc-aroc-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AROC 2020 Q2","e":"aroc","d":"2020-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"D. Bradley Childers","x":"Our push to rightsize the organization for activity levels cut across both business segments and our corporate overhead.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/archrock-inc-aroc-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AROC 2020 Q2","e":"aroc","d":"2020-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"D. Bradley Childers","x":"This included furloughs and layoffs in several business units and segments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/archrock-inc-aroc-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AROC 2020 Q3","e":"aroc","d":"2020-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"D. Bradley Childers","x":"These positive quarterly outcomes demonstrate the impact of the aggressive cost reduction and operational improvement measures we've implemented over the last several months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/archrock-inc-aroc-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2020 Q3","e":"aroc","d":"2020-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"D. Bradley Childers","x":"While we're focused on retaining our great talent as much as possible, we've also had to make difficult decisions to right size the organization for the opportunity set.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/archrock-inc-aroc-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2020 Q4","e":"aroc","d":"2021-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"D. Bradley Childers","x":"On our first quarter 2020 conference call, I detailed our objectives and action plan for the downturn including significant cost savings and capital reduction initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/archrock-inc-aroc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2020 Q4","e":"aroc","d":"2021-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"D. Bradley Childers","x":"We executed several highly strategic asset sales, completed a business unit restructuring, and aligned our business for the current environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/archrock-inc-aroc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2021 Q1","e":"aroc","d":"2021-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Doug S. Aron","x":"We recorded a noncash $7 million long-lived asset impairment, a $5 million write-off of unamortized deferred financing costs and nearly $1 million in restructuring costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/archrock-inc-aroc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2021 Q1","e":"aroc","d":"2021-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"D. Bradley Childers","x":"Based on our strong first quarter performance today, we are reaffirming our guidance for the full year 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/archrock-inc-aroc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2021 Q2","e":"aroc","d":"2021-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"D. Bradley Childers","x":"The team has and will continue to optimize gross margin and work to offset inflationary pressures with tight cost control, efficiency gains, and future price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/31/archrock-inc-aroc-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2021 Q2","e":"aroc","d":"2021-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Doug S. Aron","x":"We recorded a non-cash $3 million long-lived asset impairment and nearly $1 million in restructuring costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/31/archrock-inc-aroc-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2021 Q3","e":"aroc","d":"2021-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"D. Bradley Childers","x":"We also began taking necessary action to implement our own price increases during the fourth quarter and expect these to be broad based next year as the market continues to tighten.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/archrock-inc-aroc-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2021 Q3","e":"aroc","d":"2021-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas S. Aron","x":"We remain focused on optimizing our performance through the end of the downturn and until the positive trends in our bookings and price increases give way to a meaningful improvement in our financial results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/archrock-inc-aroc-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2025 Q4","e":"aroc","d":"2026-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"D. Childers","x":"In 2026, we expect to benefit from a full year's impact of rate increases from 2025, and we also expect additional price increases in 2026, though at more modest levels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/archrock-aroc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2025 Q4","e":"aroc","d":"2026-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"D. Childers","x":"And so while we expect to see price increases on our installed base in 2026 at a more modest level, as I think I mentioned in my prepared remarks, we do see price increasing in the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/archrock-aroc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2025 Q4","e":"aroc","d":"2026-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"D. Childers","x":"We're deploying advanced digital tools, analytics and machine learning to improve service quality, streamline workflows for our customers, optimize maintenance execution and expand our remote monitoring capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/archrock-aroc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2025 Q4","e":"aroc","d":"2026-02-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"D. Childers","x":"Importantly, with strong Q4 results, we delivered adjusted EBITDA above the midpoint of guidance after raising our outlook twice during the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/archrock-aroc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2026 Q1","e":"aroc","d":"2026-05-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"D. Childers","x":"At the same time, the build-out of AI data centers is accelerating power demand, reinforcing natural gas-fired generation as a practical scalable source of incremental electricity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/archrock-aroc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2026 Q1","e":"aroc","d":"2026-05-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"D. Childers","x":"The EIA's Annual Energy Outlook 2026 raised its view of U.S. gas production and demand versus last year, driven in part by LNG growth and AI data center power needs with production projected to rise from 107 Bcf a day in 2025 to approximately 133 to 151 Bcf a day by 2050.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/archrock-aroc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2026 Q1","e":"aroc","d":"2026-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"D. Childers","x":"There's definitely a lag time between when we experience an increase in our costs and when we can pass them on to customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/archrock-aroc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2026 Q1","e":"aroc","d":"2026-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Elias Jossen","x":"And I just want to get a sense, I know that you need to balance kind of those price increases with your customers' needs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/archrock-aroc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2026 Q1","e":"aroc","d":"2026-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Douglas Aron","x":"Excluding transaction-related and restructuring costs and adjusting for the associated tax impact, we delivered adjusted net income of $74.4 million or $0.42 per share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/archrock-aroc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2026 Q1","e":"aroc","d":"2026-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Blum","x":"You made the comment that your first quarter underlying business performance is exceeding the basis for guidance, but you didn't raise guidance here.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/archrock-aroc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2026 Q2","e":"aroc","d":"2026-08-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mohit Singh","x":"…look at the macro setup, there's a huge amount of demand pull that's coming from LNG and from the AI data center-driven power demand and understanding the natural gas macro dynamics and trying to couple it with the fleet strategy, which Archrock has been very, very phenomenal historically in…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/archrock-aroc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2026 Q2","e":"aroc","d":"2026-08-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"D. Childers","x":"At the same time, data center and AI-related power demand represent an additional source of upside with natural gas-fired generation expected to play an important role in meeting growing electricity needs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/archrock-aroc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2026 Q2","e":"aroc","d":"2026-08-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"D. Childers","x":"We have not seen sharp price increases overall from our -- from the OEMs or from the packagers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/archrock-aroc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2026 Q2","e":"aroc","d":"2026-08-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Elias Jossen","x":"If the contemplated CapEx guide is just passing through kind of historical inflation trends, how should we also think about the kind of pricing going forward?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/archrock-aroc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2026 Q3","e":"aroc","d":"2026-11-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Joshua Jayne","x":"You unpacked a little bit on -- in answering your last question, but I just wanted to follow up on the commentary about investing in automation, AI, et cetera.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/archrock-aroc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AROC 2026 Q3","e":"aroc","d":"2026-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mohit Singh","x":"Excluding transaction-related costs and restructuring charges and adjusting for the associated tax impact, adjusted net income was $84.7 million, or $0.49 per share, up from $73.2 million, or $0.42 per share in the third quarter of 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/archrock-aroc-q3-2026-earnings-call-